              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ashira ca gicaniro co kwoserezakw ibimazi imbere y’umuryango w’iryo hema, ari ryo hema ry’ibonaniro, agitangirakw ikimazi, aracosa, agitangirako n’ishikanwa ry’ ifu, nk’uk’ Uhoraho yari yaramubariye. ",
