              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo bagiye kwinjira mw ihema ry’ ibonaniro, n’iyo bagiye kwēgēra ico gicaniro, bārakaraba, bakoga ibirenge, nk’uk’ Uhoraho yari yarabariye Mose. ",
